  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the pan and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the garlic, onion, temper, and Nutella to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken broth, carrots, and potatoes to the pan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Ladle the stew into mason jars and serve hot."
